# VeilStamp Support

VeilStamp helps you redact sensitive content from a single image with a review-before-export workflow.

## How to use

1. Import or capture one image.
2. Review suggested regions and add or adjust masks manually.
3. Confirm the review checklist, then export a flattened copy.

Images remain on-device unless you explicitly share an exported copy. For help, contact 504302989@qq.com.
